{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015gy73WT2cxxePu7cR41Awe","type":"tool_result","content":"# Total Farmers Markets Across U.S. States\n\nBased on the data provided, I summed all values in the \"farmers_markets\" column across all 50 states plus D.C., Puerto Rico, and the Virgin Islands.\n\n**Total: 8,268 farmers markets**\n\nThis figure represents the complete count of farmers markets documented across all U.S. territories listed in the dataset, with California leading at 647 markets and several states having minimal representation."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2ee67cf3-9573-42ba-8b99-1ccd334d7f6c","uuid":"9a258e89-03bc-494c-84eb-e4d8789890b5","timestamp":"2026-08-16T20:47:41.583Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":2651,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# Total Farmers Markets Across U.S. States\n\nBased on the data provided, I summed all values in the \"farmers_markets\" column across all 50 states plus D.C., Puerto Rico, and the Virgin Islands.\n\n**Total: 8,268 farmers markets**\n\nThis figure represents the complete count of farmers markets documented across all U.S. territories listed in the dataset, with California leading at 647 markets and several states having minimal representation.","durationMs":2045,"url":"https://harvestlymarkets.com/data/us-farmers-markets-by-state-2026.csv"}}
